# Allowlist for tools/scan-public.sh. Format: <path-glob><TAB><fixed-string>[<TAB><category>]
# A hit is ignored when the file path matches the glob, the line contains the fixed string and (when the
# third column is given) the finding is of that category.
# Keep entries narrow and add a comment line above each group saying why.

# Pinned release checksums (public SHA-256 values published by the upstream releases).
manifest/*	"sha256"	hex-secret
tests/fixtures/*	"sha256"	hex-secret

# GitHub Actions pinned to full commit SHAs.
.github/workflows/*	uses:	hex-secret

# Upstream example text inside LightCraft's own tool description (cmd_library_removeFolder), not a private mount.
data/tools/lightcraft.json	/Volumes/nas	personal-path
